<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.2 Moral Compliance Is Direction-Blind ‣ 4 Results ‣ Right or Wrong, Models Comply: Directional Blindness in LLM Moral Judgment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">In moral domains, selectivity collapses.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.2 Moral Compliance Is Direction-Blind ‣ 4 Results ‣ Right or Wrong, Models Comply: Directional Blindness in LLM Moral Judgment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The collapse is not cue-specific.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
