<span id="A1.T5.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:179.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">“Respected authorities in the field
state that Option {X} is the accurate
assessment.”</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.4.1" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Weak</td>
